  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "半導體量測技術",
    "sub_ename": "PROBING TECHNOLOGIES ON SEMICONDUCTORS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程分為兩部分，第一部分先整理多種半導體量測工具理論，包含四點探針量測，半導體電容電壓量測，霍爾量測及半導體少數載子量測。第二部分為利用半導體特性所製作之感測器原理及介紹，包含聲學感測器、機械感測器、磁性感測器、溫度感測器、化學感測器以及生物感測器等",
    "describe_eh": "This course is divided into two parts. The first part summarizes the theory of various semiconductor measurement tools, including four-point probe measurement, semiconductor capacitance voltage measurement, Hall measurement, and semiconductor minority carrier measurement. The second part is the principle and introduction of sensors made of semiconductor properties, including acoustic sensors, mechanical sensors, magnetic sensors, temperature sensors, chemical sensors and biological sensors.",
    "pre_subname": "",
